{{also|Appendix:Variations of "da"}}
==Norwegian Nynorsk==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|nn|da}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|non|nn}} {{term|þá|lang=non}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|dɒ|lang=nn}} {{nn-pronu-note}}

====Adverb====
{{head|nn|adverb}}

# [[then]] (at that time)
#: ''Fyrst '''då''' kan me gjera noko med det.''
#:: We can't do anything about it until '''then'''.
# [[then]] (in that case)
#: '''''Då''' er eg redd det er lite me kan gjera.''
#:: '''Then''' I am afraid there is little we can do.

=====References=====
* {{R:Dokumentasjonsprosjektet|lang=nn|daa}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{etyl|non|nn}} {{term|þá er|lang=non}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|dɒ|lang=nn}} {{nn-pronu-note}}

====Adverb====
{{head|nn|adverb}}

# [[when]] (at a time in the past)
#: '''''Då''' morgonen kom, hadde vêret vorte betre.''
#:: '''When''' the morning came, the weather had gotten better.

=====References=====
* {{R:Dokumentasjonsprosjektet|lang=nn|daa}}

