==Swedish==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/doː/|lang=sv}}
* {{audio|Sv-då.ogg|audio}}

===Adverb===
{{sv-adv|-}}

# [[then]]; at that time
# [[then]]; in that case
# [[what about]], [[how about]]
#: ''Den där, '''då'''?''
#:: '''What about''' that one?

===Conjunction===
{{head|sv|conjunction}}

# [[when]]; at the same point in time as
#: ''Vi sov '''då''' branden började.''
#:: We were asleep '''when''' the fire started.
# [[since]], [[as]]; by background of the case being that (''dated'')
#: '''''Då''' inget tvivel tycks råda om hans skuld, beslutar jag härmed...''
#:: '''Since''' there seems to be no doubts about his guilt, I hereby decide...

====Derived terms====
* [[hej då]]

====Usage notes====
* In the first use it is far more common to use {{term|när|lang=sv}} than {{term|då|lang=sv}}, which is very rare in spoken language.
* In the second use it is far more common to use {{term|eftersom|lang=sv}}; {{term|då|lang=sv}} may be perceived as archaic.

